{"id":"n70748-1-8","stage":1,"title":"동생 · 弟弟","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70748-1-8-1","ko":"너희 쌍둥이구나. 둘 중에 누가 동생이니?","zh":"原来你们是双胞胎，谁比较小？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"쌍둥이구나.","meaning":"双胞胎，孪生","explanation":"쌍둥이：双胞胎，孪生；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"쌍둥이","audio":"/audio/c06be6d46636dc658e73.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16483","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌍둥이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쌍둥이구나","audio":"/audio/53e67860476f33da9d64.mp3"}},{"text":"둘","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二。","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}},{"text":"중에","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에","audio":"/audio/f0d257645978930f07ec.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"동생이니?","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생"